# Allowlist for veloxagent/deploy/docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore): the context is the repository root, and only
# what the agent compiles from — plus the licence it ships — is sent.
*
!LICENSE
!crates/velox-integrations
!crates/velox-policy
!veloxagent/Cargo.toml
!veloxagent/Cargo.lock
!veloxagent/crates
**/target
